	<string name="unable_to_determine_location_header">Enable Location</string>
	<string name="unable_to_determine_location_text">
		&lt;div style=%22font-size: 80%25;%22&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;
			Zmanim is unable to determine your location because no location sources have been enabled.
		&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;
			Clicking the "Enable" button below will open the "Security &amp; Location" screen, where you can turn on either "Use wireless networks" or "Enable GPS satellites".
		&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;p&gt;
			Generally, your location can be determined just by enabling the wireless network location source, though sometimes it may be necessary to enable GPS.
		&lt;/p&gt;
		&lt;/div&gt;
	</string>

